  p("pcm-set-u4-02","U4","4.2","Change in Momentum and Impulse","3.C","Which feature of the data directly determines the cart's momentum change?",["The peak force alone","The area under the force-time curve","The final force alone","The slope only during the middle interval"],1,"The impulse-momentum theorem states Δ p=integral F dt, so the area under the force-time curve determines the momentum change.",{stimulusGroupId:"pcm-set-u4",stimulus:PCM_SET_U4});
